[I] A getopt format generator

[T] GNU Gengetopt generates a C function that uses getopt_long to parse
[T] command line options described in a simple configuration file, validate
[T] them and fill a struct. Both long and short options are supported, and
[T] the generated code does not impose any license on the program.

[U] https://www.gnu.org/software/gengetopt/

